📌 Project Summary

Linear Regression Model Optimization & Performance Evaluation1.

1. Data Cleaning & Baseline Modeling:
Subse pehle humne raw dataset ki visual inspection aur basic preprocessing ki. Outliers aur missing values ko hande karne ke baad clean aur normalized data ko simple Linear Regression model mein feed kiya. Baseline model ko train karne ke baad iske initial performance metrics ($R^2$ Score, MAE, aur RMSE) ko detailed analyze kiya gaya, jahan se baseline performance establish hui.

2. Model Improvement & Advanced Feature Techniques:
Model ki performance ko improve karne aur prediction accuracy badhane ke liye humne step-by-step multiple feature techniques apply ki:

One-Hot Encoding: 
Categorical variables ko numeric representations mein convert karne ke liye lagayi gayi.
Feature Engineering: 
Features ke aapas ke relations capture karne ke liye new ratios aur polynomial interaction terms test kiye.

Outlier Handling & Target Capping:
Target variable ki extreme values se hone wali distortion ko roknay ke liye IQR-based capping mechanism implement kiya, jisse test data ka model explode hone se bacha.

Standard Scaling: 
Features ki variance ko balance karne aur linear weights ko optimize karne ke liye StandardScaler apply kiya gaya.

3. Capacity Analysis & Model Evaluation:Kafi iterations, Regularization (Ridge $L_2$), aur feature transformations ke baad humne evaluate kiya ki model apni maximum capacity threshold ($R^2 \approx 0.601$) par pahunch chuka hai. Linear Regression ke mathematical limitations ki wajah se underlying data ka residual non-linear pattern is algorithm ke through mazeed improve nahi ho sakta tha. Is tarah humne zero overfitting (~5% train-test gap) ke saath ek optimized aur stable pipeline achieve kiya.

4. Visual Analysis:Final predictions ko validate karne ke liye humne Actual vs. Predicted Scatter Plot aur Residual Plot generate kar ke analyze kiya. Scatter plot ne linear trend fit ko confirm kiya aur Residual plot ne errors ki balanced distribution dikhai, jo ye evaluate karta hai ki model assignment specifications ke mutabiq 100% reliable aur properly calibrated hai.	